    "scenesThatPass": [
      "KATE: What're you doing?\nANI: The charge just goes on your cell. Where have you been?\nKATE: This is stupid. Let's go.\nANI: \"Yes! Clean clothes are stupid. Everything I wear should be covered in BLOOD!\"",
      "ANI: In here! I need to get my stuff.\nKATE: Wait.",
      "KATE: I've got to go see someone now.\nANI: Are you going to come back for me?\nKATE: Just-- stay here.\nANI: Wait! Give me your number. In case of emergency.",
      "ANI: KATE!!!\nKATE: Move.",
      "ANI: Too many-- there's-- they're gonna kill us, they're- Kuso! Kuso! Kuso!\nKATE: Shhh. Close your eyes, breathe, think of blue. Hey, picture the color blue."
    ]
